[break] the-waiting-host-calls-bytes-are-not-bounded
rule: The host calls waiting for their answers hold at most 12 MiB of arguments together, which the runtime's memory limit does not count.
file: crates/cineris-ext/src/engine/thread.rs
in: Shared::admit
find: || self.pending_bytes + bytes > MAX_PENDING_BYTES
replace: || false
packages: cineris-ext
caught-by:
    cineris-ext::it engine::the_bytes_the_waiting_host_calls_hold_are_bounded
